<%- include('partials/header', { 
    title: 'Privacy & Policies | Neotia Bhagirathi Hospital Raipur',
    description: 'Privacy policy and patient data security practices at Neotia Bhagirathi Woman and Child Care Centre.'
}) %>

<section class="banner-sec position-relative" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-blue-2) 0%, var(--brand-blue-2-tint-1) 100%); padding: 120px 0 60px; color: var(--white);">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 8px;">Privacy &amp; Policies</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--white);">Ambuja Neotia Healthcare Venture Limited | Commitment to Patient Confidentiality</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-padding" style="background: var(--white);">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-10" style="color: var(--brand-blue-2-tint-3); line-height: 1.8; font-size: 15px;">
                <h3 style="color: var(--theme-color); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 15px;">1. Patient Information Confidentiality</h3>
                <p>Neotia Bhagirathi Woman and Child Care Centre treats all patient medical records, diagnostic reports, consultation histories, and contact information with the strictest medical confidentiality in compliance with applicable healthcare privacy regulations in India.</p>
                
                <h3 style="color: var(--theme-color); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">2. Collection &amp; Use of Personal Details</h3>
                <p>When you book an appointment, submit an enquiry, or request emergency assistance on this website, we collect your name, phone number, email address, and medical concerns. These details are solely utilized to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Confirm and schedule OPD consultations with your chosen specialist</li>
                    <li>Coordinate emergency care and ambulance transport</li>
                    <li>Communicate lab test schedules, follow-up reminders, and health advisory updates</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 style="color: var(--theme-color); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">3. Data Protection &amp; Security</h3>
                <p>Our website and database systems implement encryption, access control protocols, and regular security audits to prevent unauthorized disclosure, tampering, or loss of patient data.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
